# Auto: a small friendly car from the side street (D-093). Three looks as
# separate anims, picked by spawn index: drive_0 a wine-red R hatchback,
# drive_1 a white w/i estate with a dark m/d roof box, drive_2 a pale-blue
# h/s/S camper van with orange o curtains. Dark windows d with faint heads E,
# k/d wheels with i hubs, headlight w and Y indicator at the front (left),
# r tail lamp. Faces LEFT, no mirror (like the bus). The roof (or roof box)
# is one flat line of 21+ px on hitbox row 2: the bounce surface.
# drive = hubs turn, body bounces 1 px (wheels stay on the road).
# Built with a scratch script (body templates + wheels), frozen here.
sprite = auto
size   = 32x16
origin = 16,16
hitbox = 2,2,28,14
anim   = drive_0 frames=2 ticks=4 loop
anim   = drive_1 frames=2 ticks=4 loop
anim   = drive_2 frames=2 ticks=4 loop
